r</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>RNA editing by adenosine deaminases generates RNA and protein diversity</article-title><source>Biochimi</source><year>2002</year><volume>84</volume><fpage>791</fpage><lpage>803</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0300-9084(02)01446-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolf</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerber</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Editing of messenger RNA precursors and of tRNAs by adenosine to inosine conversion</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>1999</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>76</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10376681</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0014-5793(99)00590-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dietrich</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Small</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Cosset</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Weil</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Mar&#x000e9;chal-Drouard</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Editing and import: strategies for providing plant mitochondria with a complete set of functional transfer RNAs</article-title><source>Biochimie</source><year>1996</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>518</fpage><lpage>29</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8915541</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0300-9084(96)84758-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Feinbaum</surname><given-names>RL</given-name